      <article class="guide-main-content mount-guide-content pw-parent">
	  <p>In the Midnight expansion there is a full set of new gems, enchants and consumables you can use to empower your character. Although many of them resemble those that we have been using recently, just with new names, there are a few new ones with different unique effects to explore. Midnight also introduces a few changes to which gear slots can use enchants, with the removal of Cloak and Bracer enchants, and the return of Shoulder and Helm enchants.</p>
<p>An interesting addition in Midnight, is that Hunters now have unique consumables for their weapons, and have their own version of Weapon Oils, called Ammo. This isn’t a replacement for Weapon Oils, but can only be used by Hunters.</p>
<p>We have gathered a list of all Midnight consumables, grouping them by their respective professions. This list is not a recommendation of which enchants and consumables you should use, but more so a list of what can be crafted or purchased from the Auction House so you can know what is available.</p>
<h2>Enchants and Item Enhancements</h2>
<p>There are a number of returning and new item enchantments in Midnight, we have split them into the respective professions that create them.</p>
