<h2>Consumables</h2>
<p>There are a number of consumables that have been adjusted, removed or re-introduced in Midnight, such as Flasks, Phials, Weapon Oils, Augment Runes and Food. These consumables grant a range of character power, utility or profession specific effects.</p>
<p>One notable consumable that has followed on from previous expansions is the Void-Touched Augment Rune, the first “Augment Rune” in Midnight. When used, it grants primary stat for 1 hour, but doesn’t persist through death.</p>
<h3>Alchemy</h3>
<p>Alchemists can once again craft a number of different consumables in Midnight. These include combat potions, utility potions, healing and mana potions, phials and flasks themed to the Midnight expansion. There is also a PvP only flask available.</p>
