<h2>Gem Sockets</h2>
<p>The Midnight equivalent to the “Jeweler’s Setting” for Midnight Season 1 is the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/item=263897/radiant-jewelbinder" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-wh-icon-added="true" class="q4"><span class="iconsmall" data-env="live" data-tree="live" data-game="wow" data-type="item"><ins style="background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_10_misc_winterpeltfurbolg_toy.jpg&quot;);"></ins><del></del></span><span>Radiant Jewelbinder</span></a>, which adds a Gem Socket onto either a Helm, Bracers or Belt. It can only be used on PvE gear.</p>
<p>The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/item=263897/radiant-jewelbinder" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-wh-icon-added="true" class="q4"><span class="iconsmall" data-env="live" data-tree="live" data-game="wow" data-type="item"><ins style="background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_10_misc_winterpeltfurbolg_toy.jpg&quot;);"></ins><del></del></span><span>Radiant Jewelbinder</span></a> is sold by Vaultkeeper Elysa (located by the Great Vault in Silvermoon City) in exchange for 6 Thalassian Token of Merit (the Great Vault currency you can select instead of an item from your weekly vault).</p>
<p>To add sockets to your PvP gear, you will need to use the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/beta/item=257535/galactic-jewelers-setting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-wh-icon-added="true" class="q4"><span class="iconsmall" data-env="live" data-tree="live" data-game="wow" data-type="item"><ins style="background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_10_specialization_jewelcrafting_setting_color2.jpg&quot;);"></ins><del></del></span><span>Galactic Jeweler's Setting</span></a>, which can also only be applied to helms, bracers and belts. These are sold by Mirvedon in Silvermoon City.</p>
<hr>
<p>We hope that this list of all the Midnight consumables, enchants, gems and more was insightful in giving you an overview of what is available in Midnight Season 1.</p>      </article>
